    {
      "name": "Shadow Slink",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The fetchling sneak is in an area of dim light or darkness</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The fetchling sneak sticks to the shadows as it moves to ambush an enemy. The fetchling sneak Strides up to half their Speed and makes a Strike. The sneak's target is Off-Guard against this attack. The fetchling sneak can choose to Stride up to their full speed, but doing causes the sneak to take a -2 penalty to their Strike.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
